    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can augment your weapon strikes with mind-scarring magic drawn from the murky hollows of the Feywild. When you hit a creature with a weapon, you can deal an extra 1d4 Psychic damage to it; a creature can take this extra damage only once per turn. The extra damage increases to 1d6 at Ranger level 11.</p>",
